IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cpa-uses`

-- Copyright Act 2021, ss 43, 114, 122, 186 to 194, 244 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_cpa.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`training on lawfully licensed articles` MEANS Source WITH
    `used only for the analysis` IS TRUE
    `circumvented a paywall` IS FALSE
    `breached valid terms of use` IS FALSE
    `the source was infringing` IS FALSE
    `knew or should have known it was infringing` IS FALSE

`training on articles behind a circumvented paywall` MEANS Source WITH
    `used only for the analysis` IS TRUE
    `circumvented a paywall` IS TRUE
    `breached valid terms of use` IS FALSE
    `the source was infringing` IS FALSE
    `knew or should have known it was infringing` IS FALSE

`scraping in breach of valid site terms` MEANS Source WITH
    `used only for the analysis` IS TRUE
    `circumvented a paywall` IS FALSE
    `breached valid terms of use` IS TRUE
    `the source was infringing` IS FALSE
    `knew or should have known it was infringing` IS FALSE

`using a pirated dataset unknowingly` MEANS Source WITH
    `used only for the analysis` IS TRUE
    `circumvented a paywall` IS FALSE
    `breached valid terms of use` IS FALSE
    `the source was infringing` IS TRUE
    `knew or should have known it was infringing` IS FALSE

`using a dataset from a notorious piracy site` MEANS Source WITH
    `used only for the analysis` IS TRUE
    `circumvented a paywall` IS FALSE
    `breached valid terms of use` IS FALSE
    `the source was infringing` IS TRUE
    `knew or should have known it was infringing` IS TRUE

`reselling the analysis copies` MEANS Source WITH
    `used only for the analysis` IS FALSE
    `circumvented a paywall` IS FALSE
    `breached valid terms of use` IS FALSE
    `the source was infringing` IS FALSE
    `knew or should have known it was infringing` IS FALSE

§ `ss 114, 122`

#ASSERT `the last year of copyright in a published work` TRUE 1980 1950 EQUALS 2050
#ASSERT `the last year of copyright in a published work` FALSE 0 1960 EQUALS 2030

#ASSERT `the last year of copyright in a sound recording` 1975 EQUALS 2045

§ `ss 186 to 188`

#ASSERT `a contract term can exclude the use` `fair use` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `a contract term can exclude the use` `fair use` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `a contract term can exclude the use` `fair use` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a contract term can exclude the use` `computational data analysis` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `a contract term can exclude the use` `computer program backup` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `a contract term can exclude the use` `library copying` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `a contract term can exclude the use` `use in legal proceedings` TRUE TRUE

§ `ss 190 to 192`

#ASSERT `the use is fair` `reporting news` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the use is fair` `reporting news` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the use is fair` `criticism or review` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `the use is fair` `criticism or review` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `the use is fair` `other` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the use is fair` `other` FALSE TRUE FALSE

§ `ss 43, 194`

#ASSERT `the copy is a reasonable portion` 300 30 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the copy is a reasonable portion` 300 31 FALSE
#ASSERT `the copy is a reasonable portion` 300 60 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the copy is a reasonable portion` 8 1 FALSE

§ `s 244`

#ASSERT `the copying is permitted for data analysis` `training on lawfully licensed articles`
#ASSERT NOT `the copying is permitted for data analysis` `training on articles behind a circumvented paywall`
#ASSERT NOT `the copying is permitted for data analysis` `scraping in breach of valid site terms`
#ASSERT `the copying is permitted for data analysis` `using a pirated dataset unknowingly`
#ASSERT NOT `the copying is permitted for data analysis` `using a dataset from a notorious piracy site`
#ASSERT NOT `the copying is permitted for data analysis` `reselling the analysis copies`

